ripts/2026/04/28/varonis-vrns-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[2,2,0,2.21],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[2,1,1,2.21],"guidance":[3,3,0,3.31,{"raise":3,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0727,"r5":0.0774,"r20":0.1887,"r1_spy":0.0729,"r5_spy":0.0605,"r20_spy":0.1342}}],"quotes":[{"c":"VRNS 2018 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2018-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"Our platforms eliminate competitive manual cleanup project and automates manual protection routines, so we bring security and cost savings together, providing understaffed security in IT departments with the solution they need.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/01/varonis-systems-vrns-q1-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"VRNS 2019 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2019-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"Today we raised the guidance to 45%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VRNS 2019 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2019-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"We are effectively raising our guidance on a normalized basis for the third quarter versus what was implied in our prior full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2020-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yakov Faitelson","x":"In addition, we have taken further measures to examine all projects and activities and are taking cost savings actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2020-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Melissa Franchi","x":"You mentioned that there is going to be a hiring freeze in place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2020-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"Our Q2 operating margin was well ahead of our guidance as we: a, meaningfully outperformed on the topline; b, benefited from COVID-related cost savings, primarily due to travel and marketing activities; and c, continued prudent management of expenses across the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2020-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"When we talked at the end of Q1 about the hiring freeze, we continued to hire quota-carrying reps across the different geographies, because we saw the opportunity ahead and we will continue to do that going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"During the quarter, we benefited from a meaningful outperformance on the top line, driven by larger new customer adoption and existing customer expansion, COVID-related cost savings primarily due to travel and marketing activities, and continued prudent management of expenses across the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"We also see that we have very good ability to attract new customers in the right size.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2021-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"Which bring me to the overriding need and growing demand to streamline processes through automation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/08/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2020 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2021-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"In Q4, we again benefited from meaningful outperformance on the top line, ongoing prudent expense management and, like everyone else, COVID-related cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/08/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2021 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2021-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"For the full year, we're raising our guidance and now expect total revenues of $365 million to $370 million, representing growth of 25% to 26%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2021 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2021-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"We raised, like you said, we raised the full year guidance to 25% to 26%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2021 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2021-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"For the full year, we are raising our guidance, and now expect total revenues of $375 million to $379 million, representing growth of 28% to 29%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2021 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2021-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"I think the contribution and the strong momentum we're seeing in the last couple of quarters, combined with the pipeline we see and really the market coming to us, gave us the confidence to raise full year guidance by approximately $10 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2021 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2021-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"For the full year, we are again meaningfully raising our guidance, and now expect total revenues of $383.5 million to $386.5 million, representing growth of 31% to 32%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/varonis-systems-inc-vrns-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VRNS 2021 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2022-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"So the short version of the answer is it's both, but we need to focus on the right size of customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/07/varonis-systems-vrns-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2022 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2022-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"As mentioned, we are reaffirming our full year guidance for both ARR and revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/02/varonis-systems-vrns-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2022 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2022-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"We are once again reaffirming our full year guidance for both ARR and revenues while meaningfully raising our expectation for full year operating income despite the following headwinds: first, the significant strengthening of the U.S. dollar against the euro and the pound during the first half of…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/01/varonis-systems-vrns-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2022 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2022-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"…set and straight not start confusing everyone with all the numbers out there, it's important to know that about $15 million of headwind on the top line are against -- when we gave our initial guidance, and we're still reaffirming guidance because we feel very good about our ability to execute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/01/varonis-systems-vrns-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2022 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2022-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"As a result, of our updated top-line guidance, we are taking thoughtful and prudent steps to manage expenses across the business, which includes a 5% reduction in headcount in addition to other cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/01/varonis-systems-vrns-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2022 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2022-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"The headcount reduction and other cost savings initiatives that Yaki mentioned, should result in approximately $7 million of savings during the fourth quarter as reflected in our updated guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/01/varonis-systems-vrns-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2022 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2023-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"At the same time, there is a lot of uncertainty in the world, whether it is inflation, raising interest rates, growing layoffs announcements, or just general economic slowing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/06/varonis-systems-vrns-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2022 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2023-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"This deal was originally an OPS deal that was switched to a SaaS deal during the fourth quarter because of infrastructure and resource cost savings they could realize.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/06/varonis-systems-vrns-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2023 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2023-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"This customer purchased Varonis SaaS for Windows and Microsoft 365, which allowed them to realize the benefits of proactive incident response with this infrastructure spend, streamline the procurement process, and simplify the ongoing maintenance of the Varonis deployment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/01/varonis-systems-vrns-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2023 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2023-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"Although the macro remains a headwind, when we consider our momentum to date and our visibility in the pipeline ahead, we're confident in raising our guidance for full-year SaaS mix, ARR, and free cash flo.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/31/varonis-systems-vrns-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2023 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2023-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"That gives us the confidence to raise our guidance as we enter the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/31/varonis-systems-vrns-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2023 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2023-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"Now, I would like to spend some time on how AI present a meaningful opportunity for Varonis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/30/varonis-systems-vrns-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2023 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2023-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"Without Varonis, rightsizing access control is very challenging.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/30/varonis-systems-vrns-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2024 Q2","e":"vrns","d":"2024-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yaki Faitelson","x":"Without Varonis, rightsizing access control is extremely challenging.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/29/varonis-systems-vrns-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2024 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Hedberg","x":"I guess I just wanted to put a finer point on what aspects of the portfolio are contributing to customer gen AI spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/29/varonis-systems-vrns-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2024 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Hedberg","x":"And if we look forward another couple of years, I mean how do you think the products that attribute to gen AI spending could expand over time?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/29/varonis-systems-vrns-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VRNS 2025 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yakov Faitelson","x":"We are also taking thoughtful and prudent steps to manage expenses across the business, which includes a 5% reduction in headcount in order to reallocate our resources where we see the highest return on investment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/varonis-vrns-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2025 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"…tell you, and I want to talk about Q4 for a second, that if we had the same renewal rate that we saw for the on-prem subscription business in H1 2025 and the same renewal rate that we saw for the full year 2024 for the on-prem subscription business, we would have raised our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/varonis-vrns-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2025 Q3","e":"vrns","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"And that's why we reduced the guidance to bake in additional conservatism.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/varonis-vrns-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2025 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yakov Faitelson","x":"It inventories AI components and infrastructure, locks it down, monitors AI tools, and automates compliance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/varonis-vrns-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2025 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Cikos","x":"And then I guess the follow-up, given some of the changes that were announced following Q3 with the 5% headcount reduction, and the downsized federal team, can you just help us think about your go-to-market organization today?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/varonis-vrns-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2025 Q4","e":"vrns","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Shaul Eyal","x":"If I have to look at today's performance, can you offer us and investors your viewpoint as to whether AI is augmenting security or whether there's room for concerns based on potential market disruption?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/varonis-vrns-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2026 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yakov Faitelson","x":"In Q1, ServiceNow, a global leader of workflow automation, expanded its Varonis investments to cover internal AI systems and e-mail security, including protection against advanced phishing and social engineering attacks used by AI-powered adversaries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/varonis-vrns-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2026 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yakov Faitelson","x":"I think that what you mainly see just from a broader marketing, obviously, everybody just investing a lot in AI tooling and understanding how they can just derive real value from it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/varonis-vrns-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2026 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2026-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yakov Faitelson","x":"So just reduction in headcount is not something that we are feeling and affecting our pricing in any way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/varonis-vrns-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2026 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2026-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Hedberg","x":"I guess there's a lot of uncertainty in the market, whether it's the Iran war, maybe demand trends in the Middle East or even some of the headcount reductions that we've seen out there from customers in different verticals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/varonis-vrns-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2026 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2026-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"Demand was healthy across both new logos and existing customers, and we are excited to raise our full year guidance after our strong start to the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/varonis-vrns-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VRNS 2026 Q1","e":"vrns","d":"2026-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Guy Melamed","x":"Our Q1 results, coupled with the underlying drivers of our business, give us the confidence to raise our full year guidance for total SaaS ARR growth to 27% to 32%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/varonis-vrns-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,8105,0,0,0,6307,1369],[35,1,8060,0,0,0,5291,1808],[36,1,10995,0,0,0,8268,2239],[37,1,9035,0,0,0,7156,1358],[38,1,9518,0,0,0,3879,5036],[39,1,7616,0,0,0,5517,1609],[40,1,8183,0,0,0,6181,1565],[41,1,9040,0,0,0,7201,1342],[42,1,9279,0,0,0,7134,1577],[43,1,7982,0,0,0,6004,1535],[44,1,10016,0,0,0,7524,1982],[45,1,8543,0,